Two lucky people will win a 5 week course this month! All you have to do is post us a photo of you drumming via [F](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ?ref=hl)[acebook](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ?ref=hl) or email. Don't forget to smile! :) Photos will be posted online or in our next newsletter and the lucky winner will be announced in November.
